{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Localization","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The prebuilt UI asks "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/LocalizationManager"},{"type":"text","text":" for every string it shows,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"naming each one with a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/LocalizedStringKey"},{"type":"text","text":". The shared manager looks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the string up in your app with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSLocalizedString"},{"type":"text","text":", using the SDK’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"English text as the key, and falls back to that English text. So"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"translations in your app’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Localizable"},{"type":"text","text":" strings file or String Catalog"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reach the SDK without any code:"}]},{"syntax":null,"code":["\/* Localizable.strings (French) *\/","\"Contents\" = \"Sommaire\";","\"Bookmarks\" = \"Signets\";","\"Search\" = \"Rechercher\";","\"Most Recent\" = \"Les plus récentes\";"],"wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"type":"codeListing","showLineNumbers":false,"lineAnnotations":[]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Building your own reader screen? The core reader asks the same manager"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the few strings it draws; see "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Hosting-the-Reader#Localizing-the-Readers-Text"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Text that comes from you or from PageSuite isn’t the SDK’s to translate:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the section names you give the carousel, archive names in a dynamic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"archive’s configuration, and the editions themselves."}]},{"anchor":"Adding-Translations","type":"heading","text":"Adding Translations","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each case of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/LocalizedStringKey","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" documents its English text. Use that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"text, exactly, as the key in a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Localizable.strings"},{"type":"text","text":" file or a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Localizable.xcstrings"},{"type":"text","text":" String Catalog in your app target. Xcode doesn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"find the SDK’s strings when it scans your code, so add the entries"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"yourself."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two strings take a number: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"%lld comments\""},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"View comments (%lld)\""},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In a String Catalog, vary them by plural."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some keys share their English text, so one translation covers both:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"English text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keys"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"\"Search\"","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/LocalizedStringKey\/search"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/LocalizedStringKey\/searchBarPlaceholder"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"\"You're offline\"","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/LocalizedStringKey\/offlineTitle"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/LocalizedStringKey\/errorLoadingOfflineTitle"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"\"Order by added\"","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/LocalizedStringKey\/orderByDownloaded"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/LocalizedStringKey\/orderByBookmarked"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To word them differently, replace them in code."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Replacing-Strings-in-Code","type":"heading","text":"Replacing Strings in Code","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Subclass "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/LocalizationManager","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" and override"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/LocalizationManager\/localizedString(for:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" to supply your own text for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"some keys, from your own strings or your server, and call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"super"},{"type":"text","text":" for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rest:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","copyToClipboard":true,"syntax":"swift","showLineNumbers":false,"wrap":0,"lineAnnotations":[],"code":["final class BrandLocalizationManager: LocalizationManager {","    override func localizedString(for key: LocalizedStringKey) -> String {","        switch key {","        case .bookmarks:","            return NSLocalizedString(\"Saved\", comment: \"Title of the saved pages screen\")","        case .searchBarPlaceholder:","            return NSLocalizedString(\"Search past editions\", comment: \"Search field placeholder\")","        case .commentButtonByline(let count?) where count > 99:","            return \"99+\"","        default:","            return super.localizedString(for: key)","        }","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Install it as the shared manager before you create any of the SDK’s view"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"controllers, for example when your app launches:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","copyToClipboard":true,"syntax":"swift","showLineNumbers":false,"wrap":0,"lineAnnotations":[],"code":["LocalizationManager.shared = BrandLocalizationManager()"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Screens created earlier keep the text they already showed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the Swift 6 language mode, the compiler rejects setting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shared"},{"type":"text","text":" because it’s mutable global state. Import the SDK with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@preconcurrency import PSReader"},{"type":"text","text":" in the file that sets it."}]}]},{"anchor":"Keeping-Translations-Current","type":"heading","text":"Keeping Translations Current","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SDK releases sometimes add keys. After updating, check"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/LocalizedStringKey"},{"type":"text","text":" for new cases and add their translations; until"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you do, those strings show in English."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Two strings don’t go through the manager yet: the Copy Link","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"action in the share sheet, and the “Top stories” section that heads"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"some editions in the content browser.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"Replica","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some of the legacy replica reader’s text is in English only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and doesn’t go through the manager. The modern reader, which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ReaderConfiguration\/useLegacyReplicaReader"},{"type":"text","text":" set to "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" uses for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replica editions, does."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Prebuilt-UI"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Theming","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Configuring-the-Prebuilt-UI","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Customizing-the-Reader-Scr